### letter followed by star in an inverted extended grep
grep -Ev cow*test *.log
>>> SC2022 1:10
>>> SC2035 1:19
>>> SC2062 1:10

### piped grep pattern with letter star
ls | grep foo*.jpg
>>> SC2010 1:1
>>> SC2022 1:11
>>> SC2062 1:11

### quoted pattern after end of options with letter star
grep -- 'Foo*' inventory.txt
>>> SC2022 1:9

### caret in the pattern shows regex knowledge
grep '^aa*' words.txt
>>> none

### fixed-string flag makes star literal
grep -F 'Foo*' inventory.txt
>>> none

### include option suppresses the star advice
grep -r --include 'Foo*' src
>>> none

### exclude option suppresses the star advice
grep -r --exclude 'Foo*' src
>>> none

### exclude-dir option suppresses the star advice
grep -r --exclude-dir 'Foo*' src
>>> none

### long fixed-strings option makes star literal
grep --fixed-strings 'Foo*' inventory.txt
>>> none

### only-matching flag suppresses the star advice
grep -o 'x*' samples.txt
>>> none

### long only-matching option suppresses the star advice
grep --only-matching 'x*' samples.txt
>>> none

### attached include glob is skipped and the pattern is clean
grep -r --include=*.png foo assets
>>> none
